# ---- SDK and OTLP ingest on the ingest hostname (CTO-369) -----------------------------------------
# Imported inside the {$INGEST_DOMAIN} site by caddy-extra/on/ingest.caddy. deploy.sh mounts this
# directory only when TALLY_REQUIRE_API_KEY is true. With gateway auth off, /v1/batches takes the
# tenant from the request body and /v1/otlp/traces from an X-Tenant-Id header, so exposing them would
# let anyone write spans into any tenant. With auth on, the ingest key decides the tenant.
#
# Exactly three paths, never a /v1/* prefix: the control plane and the edge key feed stay internal.
# /v1/tenant/hmac-key is the SDK's hashing bootstrap and always requires a write-scoped ingest key.
@ingest_api path /v1/batches /v1/otlp/traces /v1/tenant/hmac-key
handle @ingest_api {
	reverse_proxy gateway:8080
}
